@startuml state_machine
hide empty description

state "Attended" as attended
state "Unattended" as unattended
state "Abandoned" as abandoned

[*] --> attended : Object Detected / Associate with owner

attended --> attended : Polling Cycle\n[Object moving OR Owner within radius]

attended --> unattended : Conditions Failed\n[Object stationary AND Owner outside radius]\n/ Start timer

unattended --> unattended : Polling Cycle\n[Time threshold not reached]

unattended --> abandoned : Timer Expired\n[Owner not returned]\n/ Alert

unattended --> attended : Conditions Met\n[Object moves OR Owner returns]\n/ Clear timer

abandoned --> [*] : Resolved
@enduml